{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>《LoveCheckIn》主打情侶每日打卡與紀念日記錄，讓你每天點一下記錄心情，寫下幾句日記，並保存生日、相戀紀念日等重要日子，所有內容只留在這部手機，無需註冊帳號，日記與相片也不會上傳。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費，適合重視私隱、想簡簡單單記錄兩人點滴的情侶。</p>\n\n<h2>打卡日誌與紀念日提醒</h2>\n<p>點按習慣即可完成當日打卡並記下心情，日曆顯示連續打卡日數。相戀天數計數器長期運作，生日與紀念日可加入提醒，並支援農曆。日記可附加相片並按時間軸排列，另有每日情侶問題與小驚喜。主畫面小工具顯示相戀天數、當日打卡與下一個紀念日，方便隨時查看。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-299-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-300-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-301-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-302-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1284x2778bb-303-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：LoveCheckIn</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T01:59:34.614795+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}